{
  "_comment": "Demo game definitions consumed by deploy/seed.sh. Edit the knobs here (probabilities, tiers, drop frequencies, stock, plays) and re-run `make seed` — no code changes needed. Prizes are referenced by the keys under \"prizes\"; an empty \"prize\":\"\" is a no-win outcome. Probabilities are weights (need not sum to 1 — they are normalized).",

